  "evaluation_caveats": [
    "These are imported HPC3 evaluation results, not a fresh evaluation on current ACP physics or JWP100.",
    "Reported drift is pelvis XY relative to reference (explicitly stated in evaluation logs), not distance traveled from the start.",
    "The actor excludes relative root XY position error; this limits feedback for absolute position locking. This is an architectural inference, not a proof of the entire drift cause.",
    "The evaluation termination table lists time_out, motion_end, anchor_pos, anchor_ori, but not anchor_xy. Bundled task source defines anchor_xy. Exact evaluation override script/config was not included.",
    "failed=0 does not certify contact accuracy, low foot sliding, 30s stationary standing, or aiming accuracy.",
    "Tilt metrics come from dynamic motion clips (including jumps/dance/get-up); do not equate every large tilt with a stationary-standing failure.",
    "No holdout split metadata found; generalization beyond the 40 evaluated LAFAN clips is not established.",
    "Velocity encoder exists but no separate zero-command standing evaluation is bundled.",
    "89,430-step final evaluation remains, but that actor was overwritten; current actor is the 134,145-step version, alongside a 30,000-step snapshot."
  ],
